    "Cost": 6292324,
    "UIName": "Arctos",
    "Id": "chassisdef_arctos_ACT-4",
    "Name": "Arctos",
    "Details": "The goal of the ACT-4 variant is long range direct fire support with its Arrow V missile system and Heavy Gauss Rifle. Four iATM launchers are used for indirect fire support purposes, but just like the ACT-1 this variant suffers greatly at short ranges.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.45</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
