  "StockRole": "Society Superheavy",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Arctos is a pure Society design based on the Minsk, and as such is carrying a lot of experimental and cutting edge technology that is still not generally available. Through the use of Ferro-Carbide Shell armor and Endo Titanium structure enough weight is saved to enable the Arctos to both be heavily armored and still mount a considerable weaponry with a large damage potential - it even still is somewhat mobile for a superheavy thanks to its large XL engine. To remaining noticeable features includes an Advanced Torso Cockpit, a head mounted Advanced Laser AMS and prototype double heat sinks.",
